  "about": {
    "meta": {
      "title": "About Auto-Pigeon",
      "description": "Auto-Pigeon is a level editor for Quake-family games that runs in a browser tab, where several people can edit one map at the same time.",
      "updated": null,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Auto-Pigeon is a level editor that runs in a browser tab. Open a map, invite people in, and edit it at the same time — nothing to install, nothing to configure."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "id": "what-it-does-today",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What it does today"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Opens and edits Quake-family maps in the browser."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Lets several people work in one map at once. What somebody has selected is locked while they hold it, and everyone sees where the others are working."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Lifts reusable pieces — a stair, an arch, a room — out of existing maps as prefabs, to use again."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "id": "where-it-is-going",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Where it is going"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Playing a map where you built it, without exporting or launching anything. That is not built yet: it is what the project is working towards, not something you can do today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "id": "status",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Status"
